<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/eng@/~cl_36__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (2), the following subsection: “(2a) Prior to making an offer for compensation under subsection (1), the Land Administrator may obtain a written opinion on the value of the land from a valuer.”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/eng@> .
